																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"690894224252470079","clan_steamid":"103582791475778093","event_name":"QoL Enhancements","event_type":12,"appid":5097840,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1789243147,"rtime32_end_time":0,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"[]","announcement_body":{"gid":"690894224252470080","clanid":"46256685","posterid":"0","headline":"QoL Enhancements","posttime":1789243147,"updatetime":1789243147,"body":"It has been roughly a week since the release and I am very thankful for everybody playing, giving feedback and writing reviews!\n\nWithin the community feedback some things have been mentioned several times and this patch tries to address that.\n\n[b]In general[\/b]\n\n[b]1:[\/b] The overall performance, especially on weaker CPUs should be better now.\n\n[b]2:[\/b] Some prefer a laid back idle experience while others wished for more data insight. I included two new toggles so that everybody has the experience they desire. One makes the chat much less noisy by hiding the gnomes shelving activity. The other one adds a counter to the main screen for how many books are currently on the floor. When the second toggle is enabled you can also see how much percent a shelve is filled.\n\n[b]Regarding the Speedrunning Achievement[\/b]\n\nBefore acting too fast, I really wanted to see what different people think. While around 10% of you have been fine with the current speed cap, others seemed to struggle really hard. While it [b]is[\/b] intended that you need strategy and active gameplay to be able achieve it, it also shouldn't feel unfair.\n\n[b]1:[\/b] I removed the RNG for customer appearances. If one is able to finish the game in a certain time, you can too.\n\n[b]2:[\/b] Certain types of customers appear earlier in the game. Although I don't want to spoil what the condition for them spawning is (that is for you to discover), they do now a notch earlier, giving you more time to earn money.\n\n[b]2:[\/b] Players with a weaker CPU have a slight disadvantage due to some physic stuff being run slower. The new performance enhancement makes this less impactful.\n\nIn a nutshell: Before I balanced the game in a way so that a good strategy would land you roughly around the 90 minute mark. The new balancing gives you around 10 minutes extra spare time. I hope this is a good middle ground for everybody.\n\n","commentcount":4,"tags":["patchnotes","mod_reviewed","ModAct_1890460210_1789244563_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"569297137117171457","event_gid":"690894224252470079","voteupcount":50,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"569297137117171457","rtime32_last_modified":1791700017,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1789244563,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1789243147,"votes_up":50,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"583933421007629739","gidfeature2":"569297137117171457"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":[],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1789243147,"event_gid":"690894224252470079","announcement_gid":"690894224252470080","clan_account_id":46256685}}};
						</script>
					

