								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Tidy up the library</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >All <strong>6,655 books</strong> are spilled across the floor. Your gnomes shelve it away, and the library's slowly returning to beauty.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Your readers are the mess</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >6 unlockable types of customers visit your library and pay for the privilege of pulling your hard-shelved books back onto the floor. Income and mess have the same source: your customers. So the master lever is the <strong>door sign</strong>: flip it to CLOSED and the gnomes tidy in blessed peace while the till sits silent; flip it to OPEN and the gold flows while the mess creeps back.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5097840/extras/8254347bba0e0fbe8ddafa774d0a64ac.poster.avif?t=1788764787" width=616 height=346 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5097840/extras/8254347bba0e0fbe8ddafa774d0a64ac.webm?t=1788764787" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5097840/extras/8254347bba0e0fbe8ddafa774d0a64ac.mp4?t=1788764787" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>You manage, they work.</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >No manual shelving. You hire, upgrade, unlock wings and flip the sign; the fun is watching a dozen red-hatted gnomes waddle, haul teetering stacks and bow to pick up one more book. Want something to do? Snatch tip coins before they fade, pep-talk a gnome into a sprint, usher a dawdling reader out. Or touch nothing and let the library breathe.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>What's in the box</strong></h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>&gt; 200 upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>15 shelf wings</strong>, chained shut until you buy their chains off</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>29 achievements</strong> and a finale for the last book leaving the floor</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >A full run in roughly 1–3 hours — save and continue any time</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5097840/extras/59eb1c8c74abb7c20eee8f2977365bcf.poster.avif?t=1788764787" width=616 height=462 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5097840/extras/59eb1c8c74abb7c20eee8f2977365bcf.webm?t=1788764787" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5097840/extras/59eb1c8c74abb7c20eee8f2977365bcf.mp4?t=1788764787" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p>						</div>
					</div>
